    "userStylesheet": "/* Readest \"Custom Content CSS\": the Kobo's device-side rules that CSS can carry.\n   Justified text (SE's CSS sets none; KOReader justifies, and Readest's own\n   justification is off with \"Use Book Layout\"); hyphenation limits 2 left,\n   3 right (Bringhurst 2.4.1); hanging punctuation (5.1.4) works only in\n   Safari's engine (macOS), Chromium ignores it. */\nbody {\n\ttext-align: justify;\n\thyphenate-limit-chars: auto 2 3;\n\thanging-punctuation: first allow-end last;\n}\n",
    "userUIStylesheet": "/* Readest \"Custom Reader UI CSS\": the Kobo's Bookends \"tschichold\" preset,\n   as far as Readest's header and footer allow, without the progress bar\n   (Readest's toolbar has one). Classes from SectionInfo.tsx and ProgressBar.tsx. */\n\n/* Running head: centred, NV Garamond small caps (the Kobo uses NV Garamond SC). */\n.sectioninfo {\n\tjustify-content: center !important;\n\tfont-family: \"NV Garamond\", serif !important;\n\tfont-weight: 400 !important;\n\tfont-variant-caps: small-caps;\n\tletter-spacing: .05em;\n}\n/* Head baseline two lines (2 × 1.355 × 18 px) above the first text baseline. */\n.sectioninfo > span {\n\tposition: relative;\n\ttop: 4px;\n}\n\n/* Footer: folio and pages left centred together (\"32 / 69 · 6 left\"). */\n.progressinfo {\n\tfont-family: \"NV Garamond\", serif !important;\n\tfont-weight: 400 !important;\n\tpadding-inline: 0 !important;\n}\n/* The strip shrinks to its content unless given the row's width. Folio baseline\n   two lines below the last text baseline (bottom margin 122 px). */\n.progress-strip {\n\tflex: 1 1 100% !important;\n\tflex-wrap: wrap !important;\n\tjustify-content: center !important;\n\talign-content: flex-start !important;\n\tcolumn-gap: 0 !important;\n\tline-height: 20px;\n\tposition: relative;\n\ttop: 9px;\n}\n.progress-readout,\n.remaining-info {\n\tflex: none !important;\n\tfont-variant-numeric: oldstyle-nums proportional-nums !important;\n}\n.progress-readout { order: 1; }\n.progress-info-label { margin-inline-start: 0 !important; }\n.remaining-info { order: 2; }\n.remaining-info:not(:empty)::before { content: \"\\00a0·\\00a0\"; }\n.pages-left-label { display: none; }\n/* \"left\" in small caps, letterspaced like the head; figures stay old-style. */\n.pages-left-number::after {\n\tcontent: \" left\";\n\tfont-variant-caps: small-caps;\n\tletter-spacing: .05em;\n}\n",
